# Erdős Problem 985 under GRH

Parent conjecture: the generalized Riemann hypothesis for Dirichlet L-functions, in the form of
Hypothesis H (`LiouvilleEnergyRH.HypothesisH`): no Dirichlet L-function vanishes in Re s > 1/2.

Erdős Problem 985 asks whether every prime p has a prime primitive root q < p. Under Hypothesis H
this holds for every prime p ≥ p₀ (`LiouvilleEnergyRH.erdos_985`).

The theorem is re-exported from `LiouvilleEnergyRH`; it takes Hypothesis H as its hypothesis.
-/
